WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.480
If your business makes more than $1 million a year,

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:04.200
give me four minutes of your time.

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:08.600
If it doesn't, close this because I won't be able to help you

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:12.500
the way you need, so I'd rather tell you now than not help you

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.940
at all. You already have an accountant.

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:19.780
Your taxes got filed. They probably got filed correctly.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.660
That's not what this is about.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.480
Filing is history. It's basically a report card that already happened.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.200
By the time the tax return gets on my desk,

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:30.400
all your options have already been exhausted.

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:32.759
So every April you find out what happened,

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.520
you don't get to decide how it happened.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.100
Let me be clear about something.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.660
The IRS isn't the problem. They're collecting exactly what the

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:45.540
law allows. The problem is most business owners hand over more

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:48.480
than the law requires, not because they care less,

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:50.920
but because nobody ever built them a plan.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:55.900
You didn't get audited, you got overcharged by your own plan.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:59.740
A tax preparer and a tax strategist are two different jobs.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:02.460
One looks backwards and reports,

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:04.980
the other one looks forward and decides.

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:08.560
Most owners have only ever hired the first one,

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:10.520
and they assume that that's all there is.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:15.720
At $1 million in profit, when you recognize the income,

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:19.020
make investments, or take deductions,

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:21.560
it can materially change the outcome.

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:25.740
Planning gives you the ability to make those decisions before

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:29.360
the window closes. It's time for you to hire a team.

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:32.360
Stop making financial decisions in isolation.

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:36.600
It's completely unnecessary. We can help you coordinate just like

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:38.800
a quarterback would help out through a game.

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:43.700
Whether it's a purchase, whether you're buying a business,

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:46.500
whether you're coordinating how to move money around,

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:48.260
you need a team by your side.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.420
A quarterback doesn't do it alone.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.020
A client came to us making $1.2 million a year.

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:56.380
Their return was filed correctly.

00:01:57.280 --> 00:02:01.740
Our team was able to find $300,000 in tax strategies that were

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:04.680
sitting there all along. And when I say a million dollars,

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:08.479
I mean in revenue, $1 million in revenue.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:12.460
Below that line, this level of planning may not make sense,

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:15.020
and if it doesn't, I'd rather tell you now.

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:17.380
What happens next is a blueprint call.

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:20.700
It isn't a sales call. We look at what you're actually paying

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.960
in taxes, where the money is going,

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:24.860
and whether there's room for savings.

00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:27.660
Sometimes there isn't, and sometimes there is.

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:31.780
And what you get in return is a team ready to build you a blueprint.

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:35.340
You'll also understand where your tax bill can be reduced.

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:38.620
The advantage isn't hidden, it's just unclaimed.

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:41.200
If you profit over a million dollars a year,

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:45.700
book the call. Let's find out what your plan is costing you.
